# LF in the repository and in the working tree, on every platform.
#
# Not cosmetic: the chain artifacts in pipeline/ and the agent definitions in .claude/agents/
# are parsed by code. A trailing \r turns a frontmatter check into a confusing failure — the
# file plainly starts with "---" and the parser insists it does not, because it read "---\r".
# Development here happens on Windows with core.autocrlf enabled, so without this file the
# working copy would be CRLF and the parser would be the one to find out.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary files must never be touched.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
